{"id":"659509","name":"椒盐虾球","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659509/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"彩椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"虾去壳去虾线备用。","img":"images/659509/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入胡椒粉抓拌均匀腌个底味。","img":"images/659509/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入玉米淀粉和鸡蛋，抓拌均匀备用。","img":"images/659509/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洋葱洗净切碎。","img":"images/659509/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"彩椒洗净同样切碎。","img":"images/659509/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中热油放入虾仁。","img":"images/659509/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炸至金黄后再大火复炸。","img":"images/659509/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中酱油炒香洋葱和彩椒。","img":"images/659509/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入炸好的洋葱。","img":"images/659509/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入椒盐粉。","img":"images/659509/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大火快速翻炒均匀即可。","img":"images/659509/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659509/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659509/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}